---
/**
 * ProblemSection Component
 *
 * Highlights the problem that Stocksy solves to create
 * an emotional connection with potential users.
 */
---

<section class="bg-card py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center">
    <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground lg:text-3xl">The Problem</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
      We've all been there. You arrive home only to realize you forgot the most important item. Or, you overbuy
      something you already have plenty of. Managing household inventory shouldn't be stressful or time-consuming. <strong
        class="text-foreground">Stocksy eliminates the guesswork</strong
      > by keeping your household inventory perfectly balanced, so you never have to wonder what's running low again.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
